/// Implements `AstVisitor2` for a type that implements
/// `RecursiveAstVisitor2`: `recursive_ast_visitor2!(Type, R)`, or
/// `recursive_ast_visitor2!(['a, T] Type<'a, T>, R)` for a generic type.
